    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Under isothermal gas chromatography, \log t&#x27; of the n-alkanes rises linearly with carbon number. Kováts placed every other compound on that ladder: kovats_retention_index interpolates \log t&#x27; between the bracketing alkanes, giving an index (n-octane = 800, n-nonane = 900, ...) that is far more transferable between instruments than a raw retention time.">

